      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Woah-oh-oh, mischievious aren't we? Pressing buttons we aren't supposed
        to? To be fair, I didn't really give you many options, did I? \n\nHello there!
        Welcome to my <b><i>LABORATORY</i></b>. From obvious do's and don't's in
        movement handling to how rendering in only one eye can be advantageous, we've
        got it all!"
